devin-search-mcp vendors dsh-devin-search at commit 4fc16d26b24b4df72fc02f3f04e593e832c79d03
(https://github.com/mimimaster/dsh-devin-search), MIT.

The vendored tree keeps its own LICENSE and NOTICE. Protocol field numbers,
role encoding, OAuth endpoint conventions, and the completion message design
were adapted by that project from MIT-licensed piwin sources. See
third_party/dsh-devin-search/NOTICE.

Local changes:
- src/code-search.ts accepts an optional turn budget (1 through 6, default 6)
  and records literal rg patterns on the success result as keywords.
- src/local.ts treats a gitignore rule's parent path (`..`) as outside that
  rule. The ignore package throws on `../`. File reads use `O_NOFOLLOW` when
  the platform defines it, and a normal read-only open otherwise. Windows
  Node leaves the constant unset.
- src/oauth.ts tells the browser it can close the page, and marks the
  page as UTF-8. The command allowlist and sandbox are unchanged.
- src/web.ts defaults an omitted result limit to 10. The cap remains 10.

This package does not read Windsurf's state.vscdb, Pi's auth.json, or a DSH
credential file. Its session file is ~/.config/devin-search/credentials.json.
